 engaged early in the year but then found out I was pregnant and am due in October .  With everything going on we just didn&#039;t know what we were going to do.    Meeting with our travel agent on Friday to figure out where. The only thing we have figured out so far is the when... It will be mid July to early August 2016.   Feel like I have so much to do and so glad I found this site!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1901541,"PostDate":1438207305,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone.   Brand new with Starting out this process of a destination wedding.  We got engaged early in the year but then found out I was pregnant and am due in October .  With everything going on we just didn't know what we were going to do.    Meeting with our travel agent on Friday to figure out where. The only thing we have figured out so far is the when... It will be mid July to early August 2016.   Feel like I have so much to do and so glad I found this site!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megewy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.17.41.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437848879,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MegLeLy","Id":284131,"Name":"MegLeLy","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79444","Title":"Brand New And Just Starting...","LastPostDate":1438207305},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0