{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79440,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77e57e9e7fe37bad9db9dc4572195964","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@jacquewedding&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m sure you&#039;ve realized now what a great group of ladies are here! They&#039;ve all given you excellent advice and suggestions! I would add that a travel agent is definitely your first step, especially with still so much time. You don&#039;t mention what country you&#039;re in but travel is put together a bit differently in the US compared to Canada so that&#039;s something to consider. If you&#039;re in the US, the administrators of this site are destination wedding specialist and I&#039;m sure they would be able to at least help you determine you wants and don&#039;t wants and the budget you want to work with for your guests. You can contact Wright Travel at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901428,"PostDate":1438126640,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@jacquewedding\u00a0 I'm sure you've realized now what a great group of ladies are here! They've all given you excellent advice and suggestions! I would add that a travel agent is definitely your first step, especially with still so much time. You don't mention what country you're in but travel is put together a bit differently in the US compared to Canada so that's something to consider. If you're in the US, the administrators of this site are destination wedding specialist and I'm sure they would be able to at least help you determine you wants and don't wants and the budget you want to work with for your guests. You can contact Wright Travel at <a href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
