od rate or what...We are coming from Vancouver\n \n Staying at the Bahia Principe Akumal Mayan Riviera\n Junior Suite\n 1 week May 24th to May 31st\n paying $1410 + $323 taxes = $1733 in total\n \n Thanks for the info to feed my curiosity!&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cheer2\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":532454,"PostDate":1229049632,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Everyone! I am curious to know how much everyone is paying and where they are staying etc just wanting to know if we got a good rate or what...We are coming from Vancouver<br \/> <br \/> Staying at the Bahia Principe Akumal Mayan Riviera<br \/> Junior Suite<br \/> 1 week May 24th to May 31st<br \/> paying $1410 + $323 taxes = $1733 in total<br \/> <br \/> Thanks for the info to feed my curiosity!<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cheer2\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mexicobride@live.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1212716683,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209777.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Corvette79","Id":209777,"Name":"Corvette79","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","Is