se-sig-lineheight\"><span>19 adults\/3 children with flights booked! 10 rooms booked!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/BM2Hm4\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/BM2Hm4\/.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dpabride.blogspot.com\/\">http:\/\/dpabride.blogspot.com\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kinkaid.rios@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1214412960,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210154.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bianca","Id":210154,"Name":"Bianca","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4c6fbad0df2edb67a59a4199b862d68","RawContent":"We have guests flying from Vancouver for our wedding at the Majestic Colonial in Punta Cana, and they are paying just over $1,700 as well. Our Toronto guests (which are most of them) are paying just over $1,600.","Attachments":[],"Id":532475,"PostDate":1229052182,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We have guests flying from Vancouver for our wedding at the Majestic Colonial in Punta Cana, and they are paying just over $1,700 as well. Our Toronto guests (which are most of them) are paying just over $1,600.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angela.pomerleau@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1226245635,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212608.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":91,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Angela139","Id":212608,"Name":"Angela139","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a79a687a829f858d3eda8b41c196f9a4","RawContent":"My Vancouver crew (half of the guests) are paying $1800 once taxes are incl. and my Toronto guests are paying $1500 taxes incl.\n \n Hope this helps.","Attachments":[],"Id":532477,"PostDate":1229052424,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My Vancouver crew (half of the guests) are paying $1800 once taxes are incl. and my Toronto guests are paying $1500 taxes incl.<br \/> <br \/> Hope this helps.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ftp8v1y2pikir.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ftp8v1y2pikir.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"chantal_duchesne@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1206512200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208924.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":76,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Chantal85","Id":208924,"Name":"Chantal85","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95a246424053d799f4f8ee05111404ff","RawContent":"Everyone in my crew will be flying out of Calgary and they would be paying 1950 pp, and for those who we are taking the flights out of the price with our points only have to pay 960 pp!!! We got a great deal.. considering the resort we are going to!! And my TA told me that prices will probably be lower in the new year!","Attachments":[],"Id":532888,"PostDate":1229109119,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Everyone in my crew will be flying out of Calgary and they would be paying 1950 pp, and for those who we are taking the flights out of the price with our points only have to pay 960 pp!!! We got a great deal.. considering the resort we are going to!! And my TA told me that prices will probably be lower in the new year!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' hre