{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.147.34.19","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32c36ca6c0e356784920263611b435f2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Air Transat $1530 (with early booking bonus) from Toronto to Punta Cana Majestic Elegance&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1854174,"PostDate":1402061679,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Air Transat $1530 (with early booking bonus) from Toronto to Punta Cana Majestic Elegance<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hot_choclate68@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.239.188.162","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390958270,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"keezy","Id":276385,"Name":"keezy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"041a9a47d258b370f4464ccbd1990fa7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are staying at Melia Caribe Tropical&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our guests from St. John&#039;s, Newfoundland = $1690 per person taxes included based on double&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Toronto guests = $1450 per person taxes included based on double&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And for Edmonton guests we are still trying to figure that out to get the cheapest price. That&#039;s where myself and fianc\u00e9 are flying out of too. Land only rate is $940 so the travel agent is trying to price up airline.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These prices are based on 7 day accommodations.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think we got a good price for everyone.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;And we are with Air Transat&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1854208,"PostDate":1402080512,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are staying at Melia Caribe Tropical<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our guests from St. John's, Newfoundland = $1690 per person taxes included based on double<\/p>\n<p>Toronto guests = $1450 per person taxes included based on double<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And for Edmonton guests we are still trying to figure that out to get the cheapest price. That's where myself and fianc\u00e9 are flying out of too. Land only rate is $940 so the travel agent is trying to price up airline.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>These prices are based on 7 day accommodations.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think we got a good price for everyone.<\/p>\n<br \/><p>And we are with Air Transat<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395332214,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.201.208.7","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c363c1a98d1f68a1c8cb3018dd8f40d8","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Dreamteam17\" post=\"1854132\" timestamp=\"1402058120\"]\nOur guests are paying $1575 pp\/dbl occ and 1860 pp\/socc I wanted our guests to pay under 1500 per person. It was hard finding a resort within our price range.\n\nWe went with gran Bahia principe Coba in Mayan Riveria jan 18-21 with air Canada vacations[\/quote]\nI&#039;m glad to hear you say this, I&#039;m hoping to keep my guest costs around $1400, and we&#039;re hoping to go with this resort in Nov 2015, so it will be low season.","Attachments":[],"Id":1859975,"PostDate":1405463228,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Dreamteam17, on 06 June 2014 - 08:35 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Our guests are paying $1575 pp\/dbl occ and 1860 pp\/socc I wanted our guests to pay under 1500 per person. It was hard finding a resort within our price range.<br><br>\nWe went with gran Bahia principe Coba in Mayan Riveria jan 18-21 with air Canada vacations<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm glad to hear you say this, I'm hoping to keep my guest costs around $1400, and we're hoping to go with this resort in Nov 2015, so it will be low season.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"magscharron@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.141.11.150","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1393252730,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Maggietron","Id":276860,"Name":"Maggietron","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.18.213.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a95ba1dbec5003cf9d52a09f17f77602","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We booked with 9 months to go and it was 1700 PP from Edmonton (the trip itself was 1298.. taxes were 400, YIKES!)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;However, there were quite a few weddings booked when we booked and the plane was running out of seats so there you go.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The fianc\u00e9 and I ended up getting two weeks for two people for 4198.00 but with every 12th person free, our trip will end up costing us 2800 for two weeks for two people :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1862321,"PostDate":1406296301,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We booked with 9 months to go and it was 1700 PP from Edmonton (the trip itself was 1298.. taxes were 400, YIKES!)<\/p>\n<p>However, there were quite a few weddings booked when we booked and the plane was running out of seats so there you go.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The fianc\u00e9 and I ended up getting two weeks for two people for 4198.00 but with every 12th person free, our trip will end up costing us 2800 for two weeks for two people <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lcboyko@ualberta.ca","IpAddress":"23.17.180.191","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1304957891,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239790.jpg?_r=1434572414","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mrsktobe","Id":239790,"Name":"Mrsktobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.69.200.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"10250d20fb080c10baa32463e83d3566","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Dreamteam17\" post=\"1854132\" timestamp=\"1402058120\"]\nOur guests are paying $1575 pp\/dbl occ and 1860 pp\/socc I wanted our guests to pay under 1500 per person. It was hard finding a resort within our price range.\n\nWe went with gran Bahia principe Coba in Mayan Riveria jan 18-21 with air Canada vacations[\/quote]\nAre you really only going from the 18-21 or was that a typo?\n\nI priced the Coba for the 18-25 and the prices were WAY higher!! lucky girl :)\n\nI was booked for 18-25, but Air Canada changed us to 17-24, but from Calgary we are paying $1565 PP and out of Toronto $1465.  They also gave us awesome rates to get the guests to either of these cities who lived elsewhere.   We also get every 17th person free, so hope to get 2!\n\nKids were around $971, and single bookings $1711\/$1611 respectively.\n\nI think with my family of 4 we paid $5066.. eek!","Attachments":[],"Id":1862326,"PostDate":1406297708,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Dreamteam17, on 06 June 2014 - 08:35 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Our guests are paying $1575 pp\/dbl occ and 1860 pp\/socc I wanted our guests to pay under 1500 per person. It was hard finding a resort within our price range.<br><br>\nWe went with gran Bahia principe Coba in Mayan Riveria jan 18-21 with air Canada vacations<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are you really only going from the 18-21 or was that a typo?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I priced the Coba for the 18-25 and the prices were WAY higher!! lucky girl <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was booked for 18-25, but Air Canada changed us to 17-24, but from Calgary we are paying $1565 PP and out of Toronto $1465.\u00a0 They also gave us awesome rates to get the guests to either of these cities who lived elsewhere.\u00a0\u00a0 We also get every 17th person free, so hope to get 2!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Kids were around $971, and single bookings $1711\/$1611 respectively.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think with my family of 4 we paid $5066.. eek!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.25.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61b2c807c119ce28aad5f7bf69cdd20f","RawContent":"Our wedding is in the height of high season (feb 29) so 7 nights flight, accommodation and transfers is costing our guests $1785 plus tax ($150 because of a sale we locked with sunwing)... So basically $2000 for the basic luxury jacuzzi suite at Azul Sensatori. Family Suites are a bit more. Only $200 surcharge for single supplements and kids were about 55% of adult rate. We really didn&#039;t want to go over $2000pp... But with high season and a five star resort we are happy. \n\n\nIt was about $300 cheaper out of YYZ but this rate was for direct from YYC and YVR. Now it&#039;s just my job to plan a fantastic week where they feel as spoiled and loved as we do with them using their holidays with us. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1862333,"PostDate":1406298416,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Our wedding is in the height of high season (feb 29) so 7 nights flight, accommodation and transfers is costing our guests $1785 plus tax ($150 because of a sale we locked with sunwing)... So basically $2000 for the basic luxury jacuzzi suite at Azul Sensatori. Family Suites are a bit more. Only $200 surcharge for single supplements and kids were about 55% of adult rate. We really didn't want to go over $2000pp... But with high season and a five star resort we are happy. <br><br>\nIt was about $300 cheaper out of YYZ but this rate was for direct from YYC and YVR. Now it's just my job to plan a fantastic week where they feel as spoiled and loved as we do with them using their holidays with us. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.226.112.144","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1406299086,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8a5d23c8580771f9631fc7b7bfbbfc9f","RawContent":"We&#039;re just before high holiday season - December 14-21, 2014 at Beach Palace in Cancun\n\n\nOur double occupancy rate is $1770 all in before any discounts applied from Toronto direct to Cancun through Air Canada for one week. We get every 11th adult free, and I think we will have 3 that we&#039;re going to apply back to make everyone&#039;s rate lower. Should be around 1650-1700ish after. We have some people staying just 5 nights and it&#039;s about 100 less\n\n\nOur rate is a bit higher than we wanted guests to pay, but we think it&#039;s worth it because it&#039;s a beautiful hotel right on the main strip with a fantastic beach. Also, our guests will get $1500 credit  per room to use on golf, tours, spa, upgrades, etc. That was a big selling point for us","Attachments":[],"Id":1862344,"PostDate":1406299061,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We're just before high holiday season - December 14-21, 2014 at Beach Palace in Cancun<br><br>\nOur double occupancy rate is $1770 all in before any discounts applied from Toronto direct to Cancun through Air Canada for one week. We get every 11th adult free, and I think we will have 3 that we're going to apply back to make everyone's rate lower. Should be around 1650-1700ish after. We have some people staying just 5 nights and it's about 100 less<br><br>\nOur rate is a bit higher than we wanted guests to pay, but we think it's worth it because it's a beautiful hotel right on the main strip with a fantastic beach. Also, our guests will get $1500 credit  per room to use on golf, tours, spa, upgrades, etc. That was a big selling point for us\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395594948,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"94400cdf59b1a1173f58f6ec8c202f29","RawContent":"[quote name=\"tygrrlily\" post=\"1862344\" timestamp=\"1406313461\"]\nWe&#039;re just before high holiday season - December 14-21, 2014 at Beach Palace in Cancun\n\nOur double occupancy rate is $1770 all in before any discounts applied from Toronto direct to Cancun through Air Canada for one week. We get every 11th adult free, and I think we will have 3 that we&#039;re going to apply back to make everyone&#039;s rate lower. Should be around 1650-1700ish after. We have some people staying just 5 nights and it&#039;s about 100 less\n\nOur rate is a bit higher than we wanted guests to pay, but we think it&#039;s worth it because it&#039;s a beautiful hotel right on the main strip with a fantastic beach. Also, our guests will get $1500 credit per room to use on golf, tours, spa, upgrades, etc. That was a big selling point for us[\/quote]\nIt&#039;s funny because we get every 17th free, but some AC ladies on here get every 11th.  When I was on Expedia looking at our resort with AC, it mentioned both.  Oh well, if our numbers stand we get 2 free, but should definitely get 1.    Wonder if it is because of other bonus&#039; ? I also get upgraded to first class.   Right now our rates are over $200 cheaper than anything listed so that just makes me happy, so my guests know they got a good deal.","Attachments":[],"Id":1865500,"PostDate":1407694663,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tygrrlily, on 25 July 2014 - 02:37 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We're just before high holiday season - December 14-21, 2014 at Beach Palace in Cancun<br><br>\nOur double occupancy rate is $1770 all in before any discounts applied from Toronto direct to Cancun through Air Canada for one week. We get every 11th adult free, and I think we will have 3 that we're going to apply back to make everyone's rate lower. Should be around 1650-1700ish after. We have some people staying just 5 nights and it's about 100 less<br><br>\nOur rate is a bit higher than we wanted guests to pay, but we think it's worth it because it's a beautiful hotel right on the main strip with a fantastic beach. Also, our guests will get $1500 credit per room to use on golf, tours, spa, upgrades, etc. That was a big selling point for us<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It's funny because we get every 17th free, but some AC ladies on here get every 11th. \u00a0When I was on Expedia looking at our resort with AC, it mentioned both. \u00a0Oh well, if our numbers stand we get 2 free, but should definitely get 1. \u00a0 \u00a0Wonder if it is because of other bonus' ? I also get upgraded to first class. \u00a0 Right now our rates are over $200 cheaper than anything listed so that just makes me happy, so my guests know they got a good deal.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.20.34.181","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ecff3b84427b8147ed565465c54e4502","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;For accomodations at my resort- it&#039;s 1750 per week for a 2 bdrm suite (very nice)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1865508,"PostDate":1407704893,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>For accomodations at my resort- it's 1750 per week for a 2 bdrm suite (very nice)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406722272,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7f8cb6feccfbcf9e3fb7b572911cf501","RawContent":"Were traveling in August and for the basic room out of Calgary for 7 days is $1700. The trip itself is $1300 but then we need to add $400 in taxes, which is a lot! My fianc\u00e9 and I are splurging in the more expensive room and we&#039;re paying $1900 each, taxes included \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1865515,"PostDate":1407708795,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Were traveling in August and for the basic room out of Calgary for 7 days is $1700. The trip itself is $1300 but then we need to add $400 in taxes, which is a lot! My fianc\u00e9 and I are splurging in the more expensive room and we're paying $1900 each, taxes included <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":30,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
