{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.37.219.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76752,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f9869670e64a8c600ef5be4caaaea49a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pddcmc\" post=\"1846919\" timestamp=\"1398648698\"]\n@[member=\"MunecaEve\"] - Congrats to you, too! Wow, that is a crazy fee!!\n[\/quote]thank you! It is a crazy fee. This is for all outside vendors. I&#039;m just glad that their home vendors are great at their job.","Attachments":[],"Id":1846997,"PostDate":1398681611,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pddcmc, on 27 April 2014 - 09:31 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272896\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272896-munecaeve\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MunecaEve<\/span><\/a> - Congrats to you, too! Wow, that is a crazy fee!!<br><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nthank you! It is a crazy fee. This is for all outside vendors. I'm just glad that their home vendors are great at their job. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"evelinmz@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"130.219.8.11","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1377429546,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272896.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MunecaEve","Id":272896,"Name":"MunecaEve","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.46.112.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76752,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5964db055c525a3a1f52b12bb13e9393","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;congratulations everyone!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849696,"PostDate":1399822566,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>congratulations everyone!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kathyandethan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.46.112.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1399260140,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277838.jpg?_r=1399427613","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KathyandEthan","Id":277838,"Name":"KathyandEthan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.63.242.236","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76752,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b760de6da2226f4c1cd4064860c9f14","RawContent":"If you&#039;re getting married in Punta Cana and want more of a private ceremony and reception then look into the Jellyfish restaurant, Kukua Restuarant Beach Club, and Huracan Cafe. I&#039;ve been to a wedding at the Jellyfish, and it was GORGEOUS!! My fianc\u00e9 and I are getting married at Kukua. We and our guests are staying at Now Larimar. Patty Jordan and her daughter Kristen with Wright Travel have been AMAZING to work with!!! Our guests have had nothing but wonderful things to say about their experiences with booking travel through Patty &amp;amp; Kristen. \n\n\nCongratulations and happy planning!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1849892,"PostDate":1399889160,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                If you're getting married in Punta Cana and want more of a private ceremony and reception then look into the Jellyfish restaurant, Kukua Restuarant Beach Club, and Huracan Cafe. I've been to a wedding at the Jellyfish, and it was GORGEOUS!! My fianc\u00e9 and I are getting married at Kukua. We and our guests are staying at Now Larimar. Patty Jordan and her daughter Kristen with Wright Travel have been AMAZING to work with!!! Our guests have had nothing but wonderful things to say about their experiences with booking travel through Patty & Kristen. <br><br>\nCongratulations and happy planning!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"olivia_colt.murski@outlook.com","IpAddress":"68.63.242.236","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1392674176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276756.jpg?_r=1399903658","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"colivia","Id":276756,"Name":"colivia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.178.26.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76752,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"86548f22e90e0ed4af5f3fdc6005aae7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"colivia\"] Thanks so much for the info. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ve actually been in contact with Patty and she has been absolutely terrific so far! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m so happy I reached out and got in contact with her :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1850405,"PostDate":1400103983,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276756\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276756-colivia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">colivia<\/span><\/a> Thanks so much for the info. \u00a0I've actually been in contact with Patty and she has been absolutely terrific so far! \u00a0I'm so happy I reached out and got in contact with her <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erskinetoczkowedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.178.26.150","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1392050727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Feath07","Id":276610,"Name":"Feath07","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"104.48.85.57","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76752,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7fbea3bb57ab1a25697012d9c60a412","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m an April 2016 Bride. I visited the Sanctuary Cap Cana and place a hold on my date. Loved the place! Unfortunately, I am having a difficult time with the Sanctuary&#039;s response time to my questions. Does anyone know if they provide negotiated prices? I am trying to block my rooms, 20-30, but they are slow (3 weeks). Has anyone used a travel planner to assist with room reservations?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895732,"PostDate":1431053780,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm an April 2016 Bride. I visited the Sanctuary Cap Cana and place a hold on my date. Loved the place! Unfortunately, I am having a difficult time with the Sanctuary's response time to my questions. Does anyone know if they provide negotiated prices? I am trying to block my rooms, 20-30, but they are slow (3 weeks). Has anyone used a travel planner to assist with room reservations?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dalilpino@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"104.48.85.57","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420322102,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"dalilpino","Id":281587,"Name":"dalilpino","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"104.32.48.148","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76752,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bfc020cbe73865a61c553b34596bbb3a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am a November 2015 Sanctuary bride. Dalilpino, to answer your question, they did not seem willing to negotiate any pricing with me. I wanted to remove things from the Bliss package to lower the price, and they said that would not be an option. I also had a lot of trouble getting timely responses from Hector when I was sending my initial emails. Truthfully, he was terrible to deal with for many reasons... But the property has hired on a new wedding planner who used to work at Paradisus &amp;amp; she seems very good! &amp;nbsp; =)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can book a room block directly through the hotel, or you can also use a travel agent. The rates were pretty comparable with both, so I decided to use a travel agent so that my guests could take advantage of the payment plan. My TA is Cindy Lorenz. Her email is&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:Cindy@MyForeverHoneymoon.com&#039;&gt;Cindy@MyForeverHoneymoon.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope that helps!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897229,"PostDate":1432600544,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am a November 2015 Sanctuary bride. Dalilpino, to answer your question, they did not seem willing to negotiate any pricing with me. I wanted to remove things from the Bliss package to lower the price, and they said that would not be an option. I also had a lot of trouble getting timely responses from Hector when I was sending my initial emails. Truthfully, he was terrible to deal with for many reasons... But the property has hired on a new wedding planner who used to work at Paradisus & she seems very good! \u00a0 =)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can book a room block directly through the hotel, or you can also use a travel agent. The rates were pretty comparable with both, so I decided to use a travel agent so that my guests could take advantage of the payment plan. My TA is Cindy Lorenz. Her email is\u00a0<a href='mailto:Cindy@MyForeverHoneymoon.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cindy@MyForeverHoneymoon.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope that helps!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kbodossian@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.215.210.40","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413599495,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"BrideChillaDR","Id":280707,"Name":"BrideChillaDR","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":26,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
