Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":2,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":251,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1900081,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":240719,"Name":"krys","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240719.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1436428678,"LastPoster":{"Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1900096,"PostDate":1436445909,"PostContent":"Welcome to the forum boards, krys and Congrats on your upcoming Mexican wedding in Jan!!! You've...","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.91.146.141","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79365,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f43acfb5bcfb45e768e23fd93f73148f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone. We have booked our destination wedding in Huatulco Mexico for January 2016. &amp;nbsp;We knew we wanted a destination wedding but we pretty late on planning it, realize now I only have 6 months to get ready for this! I am so excited but at a loss of what I need to plan and prepare.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The wedding contact at the resort does not speak the best English so our emails are a bit difficult back and forth. I try to use the simplest English so she understand everything but I have so many questions I don&#039;t know how to get them all answers. So I am hoping you guys can help. &amp;nbsp; I don&#039;t even know the first thing about what I need to be doing. &amp;nbsp;We have our resort and the date picked. &amp;nbsp;We know we get minimal decorations provided by the hotel and I have seen the dinner menu. &amp;nbsp;Now where do I go from here? &amp;nbsp;Decorations I bring with me, things to pack, how the day should run, things to make sure to ask the resort before hand, ect, ect. I don&#039;t really know anything about planning a wedding! &amp;nbsp;   &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any advice is appreciated! &amp;nbsp;Thanks so much&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900081,"PostDate":1436428678,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone. We have booked our destination wedding in Huatulco Mexico for January 2016. \u00a0We knew we wanted a destination wedding but we pretty late on planning it, realize now I only have 6 months to get ready for this! I am so excited but at a loss of what I need to plan and prepare.<\/p>\n<p>The wedding contact at the resort does not speak the best English so our emails are a bit difficult back and forth. I try to use the simplest English so she understand everything but I have so many questions I don't know how to get them all answers. So I am hoping you guys can help. \u00a0 I don't even know the first thing about what I need to be doing. \u00a0We have our resort and the date picked. \u00a0We know we get minimal decorations provided by the hotel and I have seen the dinner menu. \u00a0Now where do I go from here? \u00a0Decorations I bring with me, things to pack, how the day should run, things to make sure to ask the resort before hand, ect, ect. I don't really know anything about planning a wedding! \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any advice is appreciated! \u00a0Thanks so much<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k_ehgoetz@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"198.91.146.141","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307053138,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240719.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"krys","Id":240719,"Name":"krys","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.0.142.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79365,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"05900e657b269e7f7d5dec08c39f2235","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the forum boards, krys and Congrats on your upcoming Mexican wedding in Jan!!! You&#039;ve come to the right place for lots of great info to help with your planning decisions, so well done on getting off to a great start already :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some added inspiration, here are some magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured in our Mayan Riviera.....enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;.....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150344652834487.362195.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Timeline Photos Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/v\/t1.0-9\/988564_10153437755089487_1719856255754174473_n.jpg?oh=f654e21058b9479eb758dd39e4f5f8f9&amp;amp;oe=561D5690\" alt=\"988564_10153437755089487_171985625575417\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11705513_10153435333254487_1452088507949483703_o.jpg\" alt=\"11705513_10153435333254487_1452088507949\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10011771_10153394820954487_6084692057556613630_o.jpg\" alt=\"10011771_10153394820954487_6084692057556\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/s960x960\/11074134_10153272749959487_3259772484216435992_o.jpg\" alt=\"11074134_10153272749959487_3259772484216\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - Enjoy your journey :) team MTM&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900096,"PostDate":1436445909,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the forum boards, krys and Congrats on your upcoming Mexican wedding in Jan!!! You've come to the right place for lots of great info to help with your planning decisions, so well done on getting off to a great start already <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration, here are some magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured in our Mayan Riviera.....enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>.....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150344652834487.362195.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Timeline Photos Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/v\/t1.0-9\/988564_10153437755089487_1719856255754174473_n.jpg?oh=f654e21058b9479eb758dd39e4f5f8f9&oe=561D5690\" alt=\"988564_10153437755089487_171985625575417\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11705513_10153435333254487_1452088507949483703_o.jpg\" alt=\"11705513_10153435333254487_1452088507949\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10011771_10153394820954487_6084692057556613630_o.jpg\" alt=\"10011771_10153394820954487_6084692057556\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/s960x960\/11074134_10153272749959487_3259772484216435992_o.jpg\" alt=\"11074134_10153272749959487_3259772484216\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - Enjoy your journey <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> team MTM<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79365","Title":"Just Booked! Now Lost On Where To Start My Planning!","LastPostDate":1436445909},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
