 more (inquire to see if your resort qualifies).&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;calibri light&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"&gt;Terms and Conditions:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;calibri light&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"&gt;Offer is valid on new Group Bookings with Wright Travel Agency, LLC and applies to the wedding couple ONLY.&amp;nbsp; Offer not&amp;nbsp;combine-able&amp;nbsp;with \"Bride &amp;amp; Groom Fly Free Promo\". A minimum of 10 paid rooms with a minimum of 3&amp;nbsp;nights per room (or a total of 30 paid room nights) booked in the group block in order to qualify for the offer inclusions.&amp;nbsp; Any complimentary nights or bookings made outside the group block will not apply towards this promotion.  Bride and Groom must book resort and trip insurance through Wright Travel\/Travel Impressions.&amp;nbsp; Wedding couple to receive credit 2-3 weeks after travel.&amp;nbsp; Offer is subject to availability at time of signing contract and receipt of deposit, and may be changed or discontinued without notice.&amp;nbsp; Blackout dates, minimum night stays, room category restrictions, seasonal surcharges, taxes, resort fees, and other restrictions may apply.&amp;nbsp; Wright Travel Agency, LLC CST# 2084813-40.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.25in;text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;calibri light&#039;, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"&gt;&lt;img src=