lete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf6051bfae7c0705ad3c9592d0db3485","RawContent":"I haven&#039;t really decided on this yet.... I know that I am going to do something simple with candles, since we are having such a small number of people....\n \n I totally love this idea...\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i38.photobucket.com\/albums\/e135\/shell12367\/beach%20wedding\/candles.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n and I found some similar on ebay, that are candleholders, so I might get these:\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/cgi.ebay.com\/STARFISH-SHAPED-S-3-VOTIVE-Or-TEA-LIGHT-Candle-Holder_W0QQitemZ320155762010QQihZ011QQcategoryZ10034QQssPageNameZWDVWQQrdZ1QQcmdZViewItem\"&gt;Starfish Candleholders&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":106477,"PostDate":1189195561,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I haven't really decided on this yet.... I know that I am going to do something simple with candles, since we are having such a small number of people....<br \/> <br \/> I totally love this idea...<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i38.photobucket.com\/albums\/e135\/shell12367\/beach%20wedding\/candles.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> and I found some similar on ebay, that are candleholders, so I might get these:<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/cgi.ebay.com\/STARFISH-SHAPED-S-3-VOTIVE-Or-TEA-LIGHT-Candle-Holder_W0QQitemZ320155762010QQihZ011QQcategoryZ10034QQssPageNameZWDVWQQrdZ1QQcmdZViewItem' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Starfish Candleholders<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/i641.photobucket.com\/albums\/uu135\/dieselpug\/AdamMay2010226-1.jpg'>http:\/\/i641.photobucket.com\/albums\/u...y2010226-1.jpg<\/a>","Email":"shelleyringrose@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"96.234.167.104","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1181252160,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207447.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MsShelley","Id":207447,"Name":"MsShelley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7d5904d3f9ae981ff8f43e097e98c2e","RawContent":"I did drowned roses-\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i137.photobucket.com\/albums\/q238\/merryme14\/101_2682-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i137.photobucket.com\/albums\/q238\/merryme14\/101_2683-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Here are some other pictures of center piece options my coordinator sent me&amp;gt; I have more on my home computer.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i137.photobucket.com\/albums\/q238\/merryme14\/Plumeria--2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i137.photobucket.com\/albums\/q238\/merryme14\/101_0913.jp